# Scripts that run inside WSL/Linux must keep LF endings. Checked out with CRLF,
# `sh` fails on the trailing \r. See cmem/known-issues.md KI-1.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Source and docs: normalize to LF in the repo.
*.zig text eol=lf
*.ll text eol=lf
*.c text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.zon text eol=lf
